    },
    {
      "id": "a7c21daa-0c2d-4ff5-94d8-7318428d53dd",
      "title": "Escute a palavra e repare que agora o foco não é a aula em si, mas a matéria.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "27fe8e3a-fc79-4c53-a86b-03345c2a43f4",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora o foco vai para o nome da materia.</p><p><strong>La asignatura.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>A matéria / a disciplina.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/ebbfbd7b95174c899c2a50dad79524fb_b05-la-asignatura.mp3?Expires=1794099529&Signature=L-yT-1oqTpIosbrIxpRCnAH9wH5RAbaoi1uibPfETCbOIW3kKcdezbQd~qKg8nyW2-~zza~16j7MU02yLEmkiKwJQKhqPSLrPZojj5AHQKFgTaPgQ0vJF9hEfSWk1AKltRmbSD0vxZuVRn7eoqhwepMRBNrPKkuHkezPlMoNd1uBt~tjunBQx60XV6bE3b3g1plG9Mz3ud5Qgp7vOnaGj8JxhQV~k-c6IJN7Nv-~HHMcirHlMKc5yVMA9PuLPfswAgp9N6r9wNzinBpBpFFdsOMHO7XQAhyFBmEb9y-fNgoteBD9I8Ji7W8f~7n8rwjOOrqtozj55QuFS71QX78S8w__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
